# Brain pool: a local catalog override (--brains-file / MANA_BRAINS_FILE).
# Only the root-level one is ignored, so a deliberately committed example
# catalog elsewhere in the tree stays tracked. API keys never live in this
# file (they come from the env vars named by api_key_env), but endpoints
# and model choices are per-machine.
/brains.json
brains.local.json

